--- !u!114 &941349561
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 941349559}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eef1ffb9e8c0554428bbc8af051d6c0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialOptionsController
  pages:
  - loreLine1: Higher beings, these words are for you alone.
    loreLine2: The phone runs automatically; Press SPACE to jump; Time it carefully
      to avoid dangers.
    loreLine3: To jump
    loreLine4: Or you can also use Left Click to jump
    labelLeft: RUN
    labelRight: JUMP
    silhouetteLeft: {fileID: -2274363484027164459, guid: 6d915a156a2379e4781641652742be33, type: 3}
    silhouetteRight: {fileID: -5089799229287275800, guid: 8017a0a841443464ebecc663a0e458b8, type: 3}
    imageLeft: {fileID: -5858099061022299432, guid: d6b24f03ade741948923c80f4c388e4f, type: 3}
    imageRight: {fileID: -6251650479528684544, guid: 48bf83f0a8c1108479bc929add2764c7, type: 3}
    inputLeft: SPACE
    inputRight: Left Click
  - loreLine1: You can jump over the boxes and walk on them.
    loreLine2: But if you touch them from the side, you lose.
    loreLine3: Jump to survive.
    loreLine4: Touching hazards = damage or defeat.
    labelLeft: Walk on the summit
    labelRight: But watch out!
    silhouetteLeft: {fileID: -364910264298103508, guid: 10759cbc0889ab64aa1ecaa4332521fb, type: 3}
    silhouetteRight: {fileID: -7722736440016689869, guid: 225b6a25366f9824db073ab45b61aef7, type: 3}
    imageLeft: {fileID: 0}
    imageRight: {fileID: 0}
    inputLeft: 
    inputRight: 
  - loreLine1: "Not everything that looks harmless\u2026 is safe."
    loreLine2: Objects on the floor (such as papers) should be avoided by jumping
      over them.
    loreLine3: Jump to survive.
    loreLine4: Touching hazards = damage or defeat.
    labelLeft: CAREFUL
    labelRight: JUMP
    silhouetteLeft: {fileID: 1471698999076470864, guid: 6d18edd99f15f974cb371696091832ff, type: 3}
    silhouetteRight: {fileID: -8418272870477287439, guid: aa6ff0474fd2ba146bd9c70df62a308e, type: 3}
    imageLeft: {fileID: 0}
    imageRight: {fileID: 0}
    inputLeft: 
    inputRight: 
  - loreLine1: Notifications are your worst enemy.
    loreLine2: They appear suddenly in the path; there's always a sound beforehand
      to alert you.
    loreLine3: Listen, React, Survive.
    loreLine4: 
    labelLeft: SOUNDS
    labelRight: RAPID REACTION
    silhouetteLeft: {fileID: -7792694739532830327, guid: c959ac05b2efb2642930c3b6e0d730ea, type: 3}
    silhouetteRight: {fileID: -49578503611327746, guid: 0921f076e03a69b49979c1621979d602, type: 3}
    imageLeft: {fileID: 0}
    imageRight: {fileID: 0}
    inputLeft: 
    inputRight: 
  - loreLine1: You start with 15% battery
    loreLine2: "The battery decreases over time and when damaged. If it reaches 0%
      \u2192 Game Over"
    loreLine3: Reach the charger before it's too late.
    loreLine4: 
    labelLeft: YOUR LIFE...
    labelRight: IS YOUR BATTERY
    silhouetteLeft: {fileID: -2585399260873951142, guid: 448e8441f10a55947bd35ec0e73e8547, type: 3}
    silhouetteRight: {fileID: -7045605488209839479, guid: 3781be107bf5c3a4d8340d978a9d3f3d, type: 3}
    imageLeft: {fileID: 0}
    imageRight: {fileID: 0}
    inputLeft: 
    inputRight: 
  - loreLine1: Collect power-ups to recharge battery
    loreLine2: Some offer temporary protection, others reduce consumption
    loreLine3: Use them wisely.
    loreLine4: 
    labelLeft: AIRPLANE MODE
    labelRight: POWER BANK
    silhouetteLeft: {fileID: -4920064529860378488, guid: 564a434895410934d9d03d202a62e5d1, type: 3}
    silhouetteRight: {fileID: -8532313275666720135, guid: ab234840850a5834096f10a5cf246bb2, type: 3}
    imageLeft: {fileID: 0}
    imageRight: {fileID: 0}
    inputLeft: 
    inputRight: 
